{"title":"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Afterword\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Afterword</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the largest positive integer that is not the sum of a positive integral multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and a positive composite integer?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The requested number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/7/1e71ddac9543843378bb5e8002a94489fb8e1a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mod {42}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> must be a prime number. Also, every number that is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> greater than that prime number must also be prime, except for the requested number itself. So we make a table, listing all the primes up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and the numbers that are multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> greater than them, until they reach a composite number.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/9951f9c01fc11d2f6aa5a4c9d195c095a851dcda.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{|r||r|r|r|r|r|} \\hline 1 &amp; 43 &amp; 85&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ 2&amp;44&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ 3&amp;45&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ 5&amp;47&amp;89&amp;131&amp;173&amp;215 \\\\ 7&amp;49&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ 11&amp;53&amp;95&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ 13&amp;55&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ 17&amp;59&amp;101&amp;143&amp;&amp; \\\\ 19&amp;61&amp;103&amp;145&amp;&amp; \\\\ 23&amp;65&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ 29&amp;71&amp;113&amp;155&amp;&amp; \\\\ 31&amp;73&amp;115&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ 37&amp;79&amp;121&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\  41&amp;83&amp;125&amp;&amp;&amp; \\\\ \\hline \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"281\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/4/5649ba21a65ac2a0ba177c4617d06eaf4ed3a702.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{215}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" /> is the greatest number in the list, it is the answer. Note that considering <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31ae43326c1cbbf97aad8907b45d3669114cceb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mod {5}$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> would have shortened the search, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b45bf095f0b5df474d403504a4e72af4298abdf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{gcd}(5,42)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"18\" />, and so within <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers at least one must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>~minor edit <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Yiyj1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Yiyj1 (page does not exist)\">Yiyj1</a>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Afterword\">Afterword</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Afterword\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>Basically, we are looking for a number where when a multiple of 42 is subtracted from it, the result is a prime number. Any number that ends in a 5 is not prime, except for 5 itself. Since 42 keeps the parity the same and advances odd numbers in the unit digit, then we can conclude that the sought number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/5/9e521c1a5097323479b1801520602cdae46fb61e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\mod 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />. Specifically, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/8/d485fbbce34d73d7cb7c4171db804bc4dee2e641.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 * 42 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>-jackshi2006\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let our answer be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/3/1a32f727fe2174c22076082a124d72eb4e81cb67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 42a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3834f0cef2a1f4d8524aa5bc8e3faca298550862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> are positive integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/645ff6a61e00caa347b03801ce2a973c60d40d22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq b &lt; 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />. Then note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c528b6d85a6896c8e43dafbe52123b539fa9b4f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b, b + 42, ... , b + 42(a-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"197\" height=\"18\" /> are all primes. \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/4/3048b9ad76aad08e69fbe74c17ae7a42514ec3d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\mod{5}$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0bf97955f4eedafea7db58ac66eb4a130baa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the only prime divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa0dbef21f7b09fdc602a1c87a86ea99201b1647.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> as our largest possibility in this case. \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/3/5e3a281358fbff3adff05636dec0efda85e9bdfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\mod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/d/65d38b22cc4bb3884875f33d0048d7efe2b81b5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 2 \\times 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/a/e4a680e4a3faa58886bee04f5e4a3f3cdd06de52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\leq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/8/af89bf0ae77ee2a32637f46a81624794bb5dd26a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\leq 3 \\times 42 = 126 &lt; 215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"190\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd0ba305d40d71c3ef4f5e946dedf8511aa11d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\mod{5}$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/9/149061fc153bb8379565427de55ee751158e999d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 4 \\times 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/7/a67c0bf55a83e0428b9f9ca16858cb727dae3f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\leq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/3/663d664a86c0a9d1e69a5084e8c2133ba205c555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\leq 5 \\times 42 = 210 &lt; 215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"187\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fb4b337306026f01ae6036a87ddcd9ced5dbc0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\mod{5}$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8caef306b14052060c33d53fbc947dd7e8850074.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 1 \\times 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f87d614650f4c1896cb7ac8f8fb22776e4f1fbc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\leq 2 \\times 42 = 84 &lt; 215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"178\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/1/151f719e5e4e2028d622de59afafa49811534449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\mod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/2748e601a772ec9c9f9e253149527d8c03c98039.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 3 \\times 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/e/bbe81cdd8946bad083474fd212df7052dba3ed3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\leq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/8/dd88affe23359cea3e90636094fcf777eef6a45e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\leq 4 \\times 42 = 168 &lt; 215$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"187\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/4/5649ba21a65ac2a0ba177c4617d06eaf4ed3a702.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{215}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME\" title=\"1995 AIME\">1995 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185002\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 325/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1768/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 90/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9191/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.676      1 -total\n 59.02%    7.481      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.43%    4.872      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2968:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017185002 and revision id 257784. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}